	quest.64FE8C0AC725C0D2.quest_desc: [
		"Using &l&eoccultism&r and the &l&ePossessed Endermite ritual&r, you can &asummon a Endermite&r that may drop &l&eEnd Stone&r, which can be used to &acraft&r &bpurple chalk&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Используя &l&eоккультизм&r и ритуал &l&ePossessed Endermite&r вы можете &aпризвать Чешуйницу Края&r из которой может выпасть &l&eEnd Stone&r, для &aкрафта&r &bфиолетового мелка&r."
	]
	quest.650A8D7F596AC191.quest_desc: [
		"Cycle the trades of every villager that hasn't been traded before without needing to wait for working hours or replacing the workstation block over and over again."
		""
		"Sometimes the Cycle button isn't available; in that case, you can use the &l«C» shortcut key&r"
	]
	quest.650EB42A35DC8763.quest_desc: [
		"Allows &aexchanging one block for another&r. Can change &emultiple connected blocks simultaneously&r. Handy when dealing with &l&eEBF coils&r!  "
